 response←CreateSitemapXml request;xml;data;baseURL
⍝ Creates the file "sitemap.xml", listing all pages that are supposed to be indexed by search engines.
⍝ Which pages those are is decided by `CollectSitemapData`.
 :If ~HasSitemap
     response←request Respond 404
     :Return
 :EndIf
 baseURL←GetBaseURL request
 data←CollectSitemapData ⍬
 xml←⊂'<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>'
 xml,←⊂'<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">'
 xml,←⊃,/{('  <url>')('    <loc>',(EscapeSpecialChars baseURL,1⊃⍵),'</loc>')('    <lastmod>',(2⊃⍵),'</lastmod>')('  </url>')}¨↓data
 xml,←⊂'</urlset>'
 response←request ReturnXML MassageTXT xml
⍝Done
